cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "PIV_ADAI: a MATLAB GUI for image velocimetry and tracking of firebrands and particles"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB application for the detection, tracking (PTV) and cross-correlation
  velocimetry (PIV) of firebrands and particles in image sequences and videos
  of fire experiments, with automatic or manual image conditioning,
  user-defined interrogation areas and post-processing of velocity,
  direction, size, number density and streamlines. Developed at ADAI
  (Associação para o Desenvolvimento da Aerodinâmica Industrial) and CEIF
  (Centro de Estudos sobre Incêndios Florestais), University of Coimbra.
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-15"
license: MIT
authors:
